%C A402042 The number of digits of a(n) is 1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 10, 20, 39, 77, 153, 305 for n = 0..11.
%F A402042 a(n) = a(n-1)^2 + c(n-1)*a(n-2) and c(n) = c(n-1)*(a(n-1) + c(n-2)), where c(n) is the sequence of numerators, with a(-1) = 0, a(0) = 1, c(-1) = c(0) = 1.
%e A402042 c(0)/a(0) = 1/1, c(1)/a(1) = 2/1, c(2)/a(2) = 4/3, c(3)/a(3) = 20/13, c(4)/a(4) = 340/229.
